"<strong>Pure silicon.</strong> Warm it from {#} K to {#} K: n rises by about {#} × {#}⁵ (Q6).",
"<strong>n type silicon.</strong> At {#} K n ≈ {#}¹⁵ cm⁻³, set by the phosphorus. Cool it to {#} K (freeze out) and heat it to {#} K (intrinsic) (Q7).",
